        "original_id": "494615a3-76f7-56f7-954f-00a2399cb5ac",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Thomas Francis Murphy, George Clooney, Marcy Holland, Greg Mitchell, Misty Talley, Allisyn Ashley Arm, Dave Davis, Michael Papajohn, Ross Britz, Ashton Leigh, Laura Cayouette, Dylan Kussman\n- Films and TV: True Detective, The Walking Dead, Leatherheads, Ghost Shark, Tracks, Ozark Sharks, Wild Hearts Can't Be Broken, X2, Flight, Jack Reacher, The Steps\n- Companies: Universal Pictures\n\nFacts:\n- Leatherheads is a 2008 American sports comedy film from Universal Pictures that was directed by and starred George Clooney.\n- Thomas Francis Murphy is known for roles in the television series True Detective and The Walking Dead, the film Leatherheads, the Syfy original film Ghost Shark, and the 2010 short film Tracks.\n- Ozark Sharks is a TV film written by Marcy Holland and Greg Mitchell, directed by Misty Talley, and starring Allisyn Ashley Arm, Dave Davis, Michael Papajohn, Ross Britz, Ashton Leigh, Thomas Francis Murphy, and Laura Cayouette.\n- Dylan Kussman appeared in the films Wild Hearts Can't Be Broken, Leatherheads, X2, Flight, and Jack Reacher, and he is the writer, director, and star of the online noir drama The Steps.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
